.TH "ARC-REMOVE" "1" "2026-09-27" "arc-cli" "Arc Manual"
.SH "NAME"
arc\-remove \- remove archive members
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
arc remove ARCHIVE MEMBER... [OPTIONS]
.PP
arcrm ...
.PP
arc\-remove ...
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Remove explicitly selected members when the selected format/backend can provide normalized mutation semantics. Unsupported compressed\-container mutations fail rather than silently recreating with different semantics.
.SH "OPTIONS"
\-\-backend NAME
.PP
\-\-password/\-\-password\-file/\-\-password\-env
.PP
\-\-dry\-run
.SH "EXAMPLES"
arcrm plain.tar old/path.txt
.SH "SEE ALSO"
arc\-add(1), arc\-update(1)
